# Convex
.convex/
# convex/_generated/ is intentionally committed so Vercel can build the
# frontend without CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY. Regenerate locally with `convex dev`
# or `convex codegen`. When CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY IS set in Vercel env, the
# vercel-build script runs `convex deploy` which regenerates these on the
# server before vite build.

